        "payload": "tree b9aba9837328b5a9550394c515ecd7049a45c21f\nparent 100ba872c808946155b1eeb8c4568058f2eea0a7\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1790701469 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792966889 +0100\n\nbip-0375: add missing Input Eligibility row to Valid PSBTs table\n\nThe valid vector \"input eligibility: bare OP_2 script is not a segwit\nv2 witness program\" had no row in the Valid PSBTs table, and its\ncategory was not among those the Test Vectors section lists for valid\nPSBTs. Its \"checks\" field restricts it to the input eligibility check,\nand it does not pass the output scripts check, so it is neither\n\"Can Finalize\" nor \"In Progress\".\n\nAdd \"Input Eligibility\" as a valid category and the vector's row under\nit, first, as in the JSON file. Name the table's first column\n\"Category\", as in the Invalid PSBTs table.\n",
